[{"title":"哭张管文","author":"佘翔","text":"运筹久矣闻黄石，辟谷飘然访赤松。\n却恨吟魂招不得，只留诗草在江东。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20394,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄所思","author":"佘翔","text":"客窗风雨夜深沉，暗里怀人思不禁。\n瓜步寒潮日日下，谁将锦字寄同心。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20395,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过曹娥江","author":"佘翔","text":"剡曲青山历几重，曹娥江上夹芙蓉。\n荒碑寥落千年事，更有何人问蔡邕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20396,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"会稽舟中","author":"佘翔","text":"雪满江头路已迷，萍踪何事更凄凄。\n欲探禹穴怀司马，一夜扁舟入会稽。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20397,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"青山阻风","author":"佘翔","text":"九月江南风倒吹，青山山下泊舟时。\n射潮安得钱镠弩，使我孤帆向日披。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20398,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"上苍峡","author":"佘翔","text":"岁暮下滩春上滩，年年高著远游冠。\n扁舟谁识䲭夷子，满眼风波醉里看。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20399,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠医士 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"城市无营一草庐，山中采药度居诸。\n若非仙术窥鸿宝，门外何多长者车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20400,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠医士 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"岂必桃源远避秦，市廛何处不藏身。\n悬壶别有无穷思，欲种杏林万树春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20401,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武林道中怀吴翁晋","author":"佘翔","text":"钱塘树色染霜黄，郭外西湖似镜光。\n翘首名山天自远，美人多在白云乡。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20402,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发豫章","author":"佘翔","text":"大江秋水一孤帆，万里西风冷布衫。\n不是南州无下榻，青山生计托长镵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20403,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠钟羽脩 其一","author":"佘翔","text":"片石移来织女矶，彩毫题处湿苔衣。\n郢人自挟阳春调，莫怪寻常和者稀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20404,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠钟羽脩 其二","author":"佘翔","text":"辋川胜事几人同，浓淡分明夺化工。\n乞得仙厨图一幅，买山何必学支公。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":20405,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨中怀郭宗舜李千运","author":"佘翔","text":"溪流昨夜长渔矶，雨里柴门暑气微。\n何处仙舟逢李郭，水田双鸟背人飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cf